    "text": "Sone ki qeemat mein Rs11,500 fi tola ka izafa! 💰\nAPP ke mutabiq All Pakistan Sarafa Gems and Jewellers Association ke jari karda rates mein Friday ko 24-karat sone ki qeemat Rs11,500 barh kar Rs390,136 fi tola ho gayi. 10 gram sona Rs9,859 barh kar Rs334,478 ka ho gaya. Aalmi market mein sona $115 barh kar $3,676 fi ounce raha, jabke chandi Rs277 barh kar Rs4,906 fi tola ho gayi.\nKya aap ke khayal mein sona mazeed mehnga hoga? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #GoldPrice #SoneKiQeemat #PakistanEconomy #PakistanNews",
